    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "description": "Spans the collector accepted but failed to deliver. Sustained non-zero means trace data is being silently discarded: an oversized batch rejected by Tempo is a permanent, non-retryable error, so the collector drops the WHOLE batch while every request still returns 200.",
